		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Non-automatic switch-disconnector ComPacT INS250, 3 poles, 250 A at 415 V AC (AC-22A, AC-23A), 690 V AC / 250 V DC, standard version with black rotary handle, isolation with positive contact indication. Outside dimensions ASSUMED equal to the NSX250 (105 x 161 x 86 mm).</elementInformation>
